@@ -0,0 +1,153 @@
+"""Steering round 2b: two more content contrasts.
+
+V5 copy-tracking: paired sentences split mid-way. A = the sentence given in full in the
+   user turn plus an instruction to write it exactly, with the first half prefilled in
+   the assistant turn (the model is *tracking a given text*). B = the same first half
+   alone, no instruction (the model is *free-writing* at the same position). v = A - B:
+   "the continuation is externally fixed, not my prediction".
+
+V6 topic pending -> settled: paired evocative passages. B = the passage alone, ending
+   where the topic is still implicit (the association regime itself). A = the passage
+   plus a final clause that names the topic, with the read cell at the concept word.
+   v = A - B: "the topic has just been made explicit" vs "the topic is still pending".
+
+Usage:
+    .venv/bin/python experiments/steer_r2b.py capture
+    .venv/bin/python experiments/steer_r2b.py build
+"""
+
+import json
+import subprocess
